Nitāi guṇamaṇi āmāra"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":65,"first_line":"nitāi-pada-kamala","author":"Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"},"title":["Manaḥ-Śikṣā"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["nitāi-pada-kamala    koṭī-chandra-suśītala","    ye chhāyāya jagata juḍāya","hena nitāi vine bhāi    rādhā-kṛṣṇa pāite nāi","    dṛḍha kari’ dhara nitāira pāya"],"translation":["Cooling like ten million moons, Nitāi’s lotus feet soothe the world with their shade. O brother! Without Nitāi, you cannot reach Rādhā-Kṛṣṇa. Firmly grasp Nitāi’s feet."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["se sambandha nāhi yāra    vṛthā janma gela tāra","    sei paśu baḍa durāchāra","nitāi nā balila mukhe    majila saṁsāra-sukhe","    vidyā-kule ki karibe tāra"],"translation":["The life of one who had no connection with Nitāi passed in vain. Such an animal is very wicked. What will learning (aristocratic birth) do for one who was immersed in worldly pleasures and never called aloud, ‘Nitāi’?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["ahaṅkāre matta haiñā    nitāi-pada pāsariyā","    asatyere satya kari’ māni","nitāiyer karuṇā habe    vraje rādhā-kṛṣṇa pābe","    dhara nitāiyer charaṇ du’khāni"],"translation":["Maddened with pride, forgetting Nitāi’s feet, I accept untruth as truth. When Nitāi bestows His mercy you will reach Rādhā-Kṛṣṇa in Vraja. Grasp Nitāi’s feet!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["nitāiyer charaṇa satya    tā̐hāra sevaka nitya","    nitāi-pada sadā kara āśa","narottama baḍa duḥkhī    nitāi more kara sukhī","    rākha rāṅgā-charaṇera pāśa"],"translation":["Nitāi’s feet are truth, and His servants are eternal. Always aspire for Nitāi’s feet. Narottam is very sad: “O Nitāi! Make me happy. Keep me beside your reddish feet.”"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-nitai-pada-1","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-nitai-pada","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/acharya-maharaj-nitay-pada","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/nitai-pada-kamala","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Manaḥ-Śikṣā-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/nitai-pada-kamala-koti-chandra-sushitala/","description":"Manaḥ-Śikṣā — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Manaḥ-Śikṣā. by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-pe","slug":"nitai-pada-kamala-koti-chandra-sushitala"}}